{"id":100122,"slug":"100122-vi-sao-sort-tren-field-text-bi-tu-choi","category":"Elasticsearch","subcategory":"Mapping","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Vì sao sort trên field `text` bị từ chối?","question_en":"Why is sorting on a `text` field rejected?","answer_vi":"Vì field `text` đã bị analyze thành nhiều token, nên **không có một giá trị duy nhất để so sánh**. Sort cần đọc giá trị theo từng document (doc values), mà `text` không sinh doc values.\n\nLỗi nhận được là `Fielddata is disabled on text fields by default`.\n\nCách đúng là sort trên sub-field `keyword`:\n\n```json\n\"name\": { \"type\": \"text\", \"fields\": { \"raw\": { \"type\": \"keyword\" } } }\n```\n\n```json\n{ \"sort\":","answer_en":"Because a `text` field is analyzed into many tokens, so there is **no single value to compare**. Sorting reads per-document values (doc values), and `text` produces none.\n\nThe error is `Fielddata is disabled on text fields by default`.\n\nThe correct approach sorts on the `keyword` sub-field:\n\n```json\n\"name\": { \"type\": \"text\", \"fields\": { \"raw\": { \"type\": \"keyword\" } } }\n```\n\n```json\n{ \"sort\":","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Vì field <code>text</code> đã bị analyze thành nhiều token, nên <strong>không có một giá trị duy nhất để so sánh</strong>. Sort cần đọc giá trị theo từng document (doc values), mà <code>text</code> không sinh doc values.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Lỗi nhận được là <code>Fielddata is disabled on text fields by default</code>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Cách đúng là sort trên sub-field <code>keyword</code>:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">json</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&quot;name&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;text&quot;, &quot;fields&quot;: { &quot;raw&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;keyword&quot; } } }\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;name&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;type&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;text&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;fields&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;raw&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;type&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;keyword&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">json</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"{ &quot;sort&quot;:","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Because a <code>text</code> field is analyzed into many tokens, so there is <strong>no single value to compare</strong>. Sorting reads per-document values (doc values), and <code>text</code> produces none.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">The error is <code>Fielddata is disabled on text fields by default</code>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">The correct approach sorts on the <code>keyword</code> sub-field:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">json</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&quot;name&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;text&quot;, &quot;fields&quot;: { &quot;raw&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;keyword&quot; } } }\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;name&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;type&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;text&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;fields&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;raw&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;type&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;keyword&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">json</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"{ &quot;sort&quot;:","references":[{"label":"Elastic — fielddata mapping parameter","url":"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/fielddata.html"},{"label":"Elastic — keyword field type","url":"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/keyword.html"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/100103-text-va-keyword-khac-nhau-ra-sao-khi-nao-dung-cai-nao","title":"`text` và `keyword` khác nhau ra sao? Khi nào dùng cái nào?"},{"url":"/q/100108-dynamic-mapping-la-gi-va-vi-sao-nguy-hiem-o-production","title":"Dynamic mapping là gì và vì sao nguy hiểm ở production?"},{"url":"/q/100113-mang-object-luu-bang-kieu-mac-dinh-gay-van-de-gi","title":"Mảng object lưu bằng kiểu mặc định gây vấn đề gì?"},{"url":"/q/100101-inverted-index-la-gi-va-vi-sao-no-lam-full-text-search-nhanh","title":"Inverted index là gì và vì sao nó làm full-text search nhanh?"},{"url":"/q/100102-shard-va-replica-khac-nhau-the-nao-chon-so-shard-bao-nhieu","title":"Shard và replica khác nhau thế nào? Chọn số shard bao nhiêu?"},{"url":"/q/100104-analyzer-gom-nhung-thanh-phan-nao-va-vi-sao-phai-hieu-no","title":"Analyzer gồm những thành phần nào và vì sao phải hiểu nó?"},{"url":"/q/100105-match-va-term-khac-nhau-the-nao-vi-sao-term-hay-tra-ve-rong","title":"`match` và `term` khác nhau thế nào? Vì sao `term` hay trả về rỗng?"},{"url":"/q/100106-index-xong-mot-document-nhung-search-ngay-khong-thay-vi-sao","title":"Index xong một document nhưng search ngay không thấy. Vì sao?"}]}